  repository_full_name: string;
  // Tree entries to include in the new tree object.
  tree_elements: Array<{ [key: string]: unknown; }>;
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```"}

{"name":"mcp__codex_apps__github_create_commit","description":"Access repositories, issues, and pull requests. Required for some features such as Codex

