+5. In Admin Settings, connect the Google account that owns the order Drive folder. Select the existing **Tindahan ni Tinapa Group Buy Receipts** folder in the picker.
+
+The app stores the selected folder and encrypted refresh token in `app_settings`. It does not read or modify other Drive files. Group-buy checkout cannot save an order until this connection and folder are ready.
+Keep the OAuth consent screen in production mode. Google test-mode refresh tokens for Drive access expire after seven days. Keep `AUTH_SECRET` stable; rotating it requires reconnecting Drive.
